     There is no timeout for divine anger, regardless of luck.
If that Valkyrie's god is angry with her, offering wimpy
monsters for sacrifice will be a waste of time.  Tougher
monsters have to be used in order to recover from divine
anger.  The corpse of one tough monster will often be good
enough, but weak ones do not provide any incremental
benefit so it doesn't matter how many of those are offered.
And luck won't be adjusted--via offering, that is--until the
anger is appeased.  So it is better to use a deeper altar
and risk facing harder monsters, since that improves the
chance of getting ones that are above the appeasement
threshold.


